    //   The first miss of a submission kicks the later misses of the submission out to compile beside it (pso_predict_rest) before this draw waits: since 93dc5957e (10-26) the wait
    //   came first and took the pipeline, so the lookahead below never ran and every first use of a scene compiled one after another (Super Mario Party, census 11-02, frame 30722:
    //   61 new pipelines in one frame, 1,796 ms; 0 "parallel precompile" lines in the whole run). Kicked first, the draw at hand is ahead of them in the queue
